<title>USA: NPD to buy Intl Thoroughbred stock.</title>
<headline>NPD to buy Intl Thoroughbred stock.</headline>
<dateline>CHERRY HILL, N.J. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Thoroughbred Breeders Inc said Wednesday the federal bankruptcy court overseeing the assets of its largest shareholder, Robert E. Brennan, has approved the sale of his stock to  NPD Inc.</p>
<p>The company said the sale is expected to close in mid-January. The block of 2,904,016 shares represents about a quarter of those outstanding, it noted.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
